{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>湖南衡陽衡山日出與雲海美景吸引愈來愈多遊客，帶動秋季旅遊熱潮。海拔約1,300.2米的祝融峰上，白雲在山間飄浮，山頂觀景點可賞日出，金光穿透雲層、照亮霧中群峰。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8503337_湖南衡山日出 雲海秋色醉人.mp4 - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/62f8eda7ff7a4d82a5fe97313b2fea05/snapshots/fd28a25fb92641829065e6a617071861-00006.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>不少遊客聚集見證晨光，太陽徐徐升起，天色變幻，山峰染上紅霞。有來自廣東廣州的遊客表示，首次到衡山，凌晨4時開始登山，首次在山頂看日出，覺得所有等待和付出都值得。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.489271+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:38:11.092434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:00.249585+00:00","content_hash":"01e50cac0eaf68c5e8f0266866e14ca5316e0f71fb55ded18f19983d3d73ce29","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}